# Burp Suite Fundamentals

## Proxy

Acts as a middleman between the browser and the server.

Browser
↓

Burp

↓

Server

---

## Intercept

Captures new HTTP requests before they reach the server.

Allows inspection and modification of requests.

---

## Forward

Sends the intercepted request to the destination server.

---

## Repeater

Allows sending the same request multiple times.

Useful for:

- modifying headers
- changing HTTP methods
- testing server responses

